<item><title>Algeria cuts passport fees for diaspora in Europe</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/dz/algeria-cuts-passport-fees-for-diaspora-in-europe-40a3a0/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/dz/algeria-cuts-passport-fees-for-diaspora-in-europe-40a3a0/</guid><category>Algeria</category><description>New passport tariffs for Algerians living in Europe are now in effect, with adults paying 40 euros for a 28-page document.</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:46:07 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/dz/algeria-cuts-passport-fees-for-diaspora-in-europe-40a3a0/share.jpg" length="39676" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/dz/algeria-cuts-passport-fees-for-diaspora-in-europe-40a3a0/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
